diskrescue (0.1.0~noble1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Careful, resumable copies of failing hard disks, SSDs, USB drives and SD
    cards with a strategy per device type and ddrescue compatible mapfiles.
  * Recovery by name of existing and deleted files from FAT, exFAT, NTFS and
    ext4, including volumes whose boot sectors are destroyed.
  * Carving of photo, RAW, video and audio formats from raw space.
  * Repair of JPEG, PNG, MP4/MOV (moov rebuild from a reference clip) and AVI.
  * Desktop app (diskrescue-gui), terminal app (diskrescue-tui) and command
    line (diskrescue).

